This was auto-closed by the stale bot 60 days after the last activity, even though the branch was force-pushed on Feb 23 and all checks passed.

@flexiondotorg would you consider reopening it? This is still missing in releases as of 1.18.x, and it fixes #7516 which is a real pain point for Windows users (no way at all to cut/move text selected in the prompt editor).

Maintainers: if a rebase onto current `dev` is needed to get this reviewed, it looks like a small, well-scoped change worth landing.
